            "description1": "Shaab Sataya is the most famous dolphin reef in South Reed Sea and one the largest Reef in Reef Sea about 5 km length. In the east side lagoon spinner dolphins are located. South part of it is the most nice hard coral garden in the reef, were are do our dive at a nice shallow plateau ending by a drop off.",
