          "text": {
            "description1": "The dive site is in a bay formation allowing two nice shore dives to be conducted. This site is suitable for all levels of divers. The shallow water shore entry is easy and only requires extra energy when there are rough seas. As soon as you enter the water you will notice the nice landscape that contains many sand eels.",
            "description2": "Popular sightings include dolphins, blue spotted rays, sand eels, scorpion fish, and stone fish. If you’re lucky, you will see barracudas and eagle rays swimming out in the blue."
          },
