          "text": {
            "description1": "Umm Sid - The entrance is a steep sandy gravel road that runs between 2 reef plateaus directly up to the beach. Large gorgonian at 35 meters. Sand area with tube eels. Nice shallow area with small boulders that also house cleaning stations.",
            "description2": "Sole, butts or rays and with a little luck the Red Sea Walkman or octopodes. Gorgonians with longnose tufted bass. schooling banner fish and fusiliers, pipe eels, scorpion fish."
          },
