            "description1": "South of Dahab, 10min drive, next to Golden Blocks. Easy access via the beach, diving in a small lagoon. Sandy in the upper area, further down single blocks, changing from 18m into a closed coral reef with sand roads. Diveable to the north and south in all weather conditions.",
