          "text": {
            "description1": "Located 12km North of Dahab, the famous Blue hole dive site is a large submarine sinkhole, 150m across and 110m deep. The dive can start or end at the blue Hole as you can enter the water north of the sink hole at Ells Bells and multi level your dive to end at the blue hole.",
            "description2": "Look out for turtles, moray eals, red sea anemonefish, scorpionfish & stonefish, great barracuda at the cleaning stations and jackfish off the reef wall."
          },
