            "description1": "The sunken supertanker site near Lark Island is one of the most popular dive sites in the area. Divers who dive here should be well-versed in scuba diving and have the skills required to dive deep near the wreck. Visibility is not always the best at this site and divers will occasionally encounter strong currents.",
