          "text": {
            "description1": "Rogers Barge is a wreck which lies around 200m off North point. In high tide the maximum depth will be 41-42 m. To find the wreck proper GPS coordinates are necessary as well as a shoot line. Because of the depth , a XR certification is recommended.",
            "description2": "Near the wreck, there are plentiful fish and nudibranchs, as well as torpedo rays, sweepers, and the potential to encounter predators. Additionally, there is a substantial population of fan corals in the vicinity."
          },
